      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/FCT_DRTS/status/1977460765834535363",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory\nDay 14, Monday 13th October, 2025\n\nDesign and construction of Residences for the Head of Courts (President, Court of Appeal; Federal High Court Chief Judge; Chief Judge of the FCT, Abuja; and President Industrial Court)\n\nThe attention of the FCT motoring public are hereby drawn to the movement of dignitaries to the venue of the event at AIG Ali Amodu Crescent, opposite Abacha Barrack.\n\nTraffic will be slightly affected at the AYA roundabout, Lisa Suites, James Ogbede Crescent and other nearby locations.\n\nSecurity and traffic personnel will be deployed at 0800hrs accordingly to give direction and equally ensure seamless traffic flow, especially areas with traffic bottlenecks.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
